      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Please do not force Mipmaps on quest. They often do not work properly and make textures low res even when close up. They also take up way too much space. Forcing mipmaps breaks features such as quest glitter and static effects. We don't want Mipmaps. I've heard PC users weigh in on this issue too, some users want to preserve quality in high res photos over performance. Forcing mipmaps reduces the quality of textures and it's noticable in high res images such as 8k.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
